e-ahead log) and metadata, and start/kill the servers. The tablet servers support garbage collection (only keep the last five inserted values), maintaining the memtable for effective searching (memtable would spilled to disk when there are a hundred unique row keys exists), maintaining the in-memory indexes, sharding when a table contains more than 1000 row keys, WAL, reconstructing the tablet server state using WAL and SSTables maintained in the persistent storage, effective range searching in SSTables.","topics":[],"score":259744,"global_rank":50105,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9260},{"name":"tranleduyan/WarriorKnockOut","owner":"tranleduyan","html_url":"https://github.com/tranleduyan/WarriorKnockOut","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Freshman-Sophomore Year Project: A 2 Players 2D Fighting Game (Python)","topics":[],"score":259739,"global_rank":50111,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9261},{"name":"Simon-Dao/AirAware","owner":"Simon-Dao","html_url":"https://github.com/Simon-Dao/AirAware","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":259737,"global_rank":50115,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9262},{"name":"SiqiD47/vision2019","owner":"SiqiD47","html_url":"https://github.com/SiqiD47/vision2019","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":259736,"global_rank":50117,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9263},{"name":"layertwo/vsplunk","owner":"layertwo","html_url":"https://github.com/layertwo/vsplunk","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Splunk app for VisiData","topics":["analysis","logs","security-tools","splunk","terminal","visidata"],"score":259730,"global_rank":50130,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9264},{"name":"nwfsc-fram/pyDidson","owner":"nwfsc-fram","html_url":"https://github.com/nwfsc-fr